      "writtenOn": "2024-09-24T18:35:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e It needs to call typec_set_input_current_limit(), then the drawing current can be down to 1~4mA (\u003c 5mA), and satisfy pSnkSusp (25mW).\n\nThat\u0027s surprising to me. I would have expected only one of these functions to be operative at a given time, and I would have expected it to be `pd_set_input_current_limit` when the PE is running. I think we should probably debug that difference. I\u0027ll take a look.",
