      "writtenOn": "2024-10-11T09:47:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e For example, what does board_set_charge_limit get?\n\nAfter connect adapter to USB-C port:\n\nfirst, `charge_manager_get_best_port()` find candidate 5V/3A of port0 type-c supplier, then `board_set_charge_limit()` set `charge_set_input_current_limit(3A, 5V)` (get return val 0) -\u003e `24-10-11 09:19:56.432 [0.771057 CL: p0 s1 i3000 v5000]`.\n\nsecond, `charge_manager_get_best_port()` find candidate 20V/3.25A of port0 PD supplier, then `board_set_charge_limit()` set `charge_set_input_current_limit(125mA, 20V)` (get return val 0) -\u003e `24-10-11 09:19:56.651 [0.993621 CL: p0 s0 i125 v20000]`.\nI\u0027m not sure why here setting 125mA to charger limit (125mA comes from `charge_manager_get_ceil()`).\n\nthird, `charge_manager_get_best_port()` update candidate 20V/1mA of port0 PD supplier (due to my test code `pe[port].curr_limit \u003d 1`), then `board_set_charge_limit()` set `charge_set_input_current_limit(1mA, 20V)` (get return val 0) -\u003e `24-10-11 09:19:56.761 [1.087493 CL: p0 s0 i1 v20000]`.\n\nit seems that `board_set_charge_limit()` are correct.\n\n\nbelow is the whole ec console log\n`\n24-10-11 09:19:55.636 --- UART initialized after reboot ---                                              \n24-10-11 09:19:55.637 ![Image: RO, rauru-0.0.0-91fc745+ 2024-10-11 17:18:21 rb@rb-HP]                    \n...                                                           \n24-10-11 09:19:56.025 [0.340423 C1: PD comm policy enabled]                                              \n24-10-11 09:19:56.030 [0.342285 C1: TCPC init ready]                                                     \n24-10-11 09:19:56.033 [0.344482 C0: PD comm policy enabled]                                              \n24-10-11 09:19:56.037 [0.353820 ppc p1 init\u0027d.]                                                          \n24-10-11 09:19:56.043 [0.356781 C0: TCPC init ready]                                                     \n24-10-11 09:19:56.046 [0.358581 KB init state